# ##### Line endings #####
# Text is stored as LF in the repository and checked out as LF on every platform,
# regardless of each developer's core.autocrlf setting. This keeps diffs free of
# line-ending noise and stops git warning about LF/CRLF on every add.
* text=auto eol=lf

# ##### Binary files #####
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
